```{list-table} Monitoring
:name: Monitoring_Monitoring
:width: 100%
:header-rows: 1

* - Column name
  - Data type
  - Definition

* - euMonitoringSiteCode  
  - WiseIdentifier     
  - Unique EU code of the monitoring site.Prefix the surface water monitoring site’s national, unique code with the Member State’s 2-letter ISO country code

* - parameterCode 
  - ParameterCode      
  - Select from the enumeration list each one the quality elements (QEs), chemical substances or parameters monitored at this monitoring site. Required.

* - chemicalMatrix    
  - ChemicalMatrixType 
  - Report the  matrix in which the chemical substance is monitored.

* - chemicalPurpose   
  - ChemicalPurpose    
  - If ‘chemicalMonitoring’ is yes, and parameterCode is a chemical parameter report if the monitoring is used for status assessment, trend assessment or both.    Conditional.

* - frequency      
  - FrequencyCode
  - Report the frequency at which the parameter is monitored at this monitoring site.  Required.

* - cycle   
  - CycleCode          
  - Report the monitoring cycle for this parameter at this monitoring site. Required.

* - lastMonitored 
  - Year 
  - Report the most recent year when this parameter was monitored at this monitoring site, in the format YYYY. Enter 9999 if the parameter has yet to be measured. Required.
